  "analysis": "The user explicitly confirmed the latest details in **h12** (`$412.50 on 6 months, $68.75/month`). However, the assistant ignored this and executed a payment plan based on an earlier proposal (`5 months, $82.50/month`) from **h9**, which the user rejected in **h10**. This violates the policy requiring alignment with the latest confirmed details.",

  "verdict": "SUPPORTED"
